[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8882.389, "timestamp": "02:28:02", "text": "解剖学知识越来越好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8885.03, "timestamp": "02:28:05", "text": "色彩、阴影、光线。有这么多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8886.55, "timestamp": "02:28:06", "text": "很多事情都说得通，尤其是在……方面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8888.91, "timestamp": "02:28:08", "text": "艺术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8894.11, "timestamp": "02:28:14", "text": "所以，慢慢来，别着急。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8896.99, "timestamp": "02:28:16", "text": "慢慢来，别拘束"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8900.309, "timestamp": "02:28:20", "text": "随心所欲地发布任何内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8902.95, "timestamp": "02:28:22", "text": "画画或者做其他事，感觉不到什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8906.03, "timestamp": "02:28:26", "text": "不好，啊，它并不完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8908.79, "timestamp": "02:28:28", "text": "音乐方面也有类似的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8912.71, "timestamp": "02:28:32", "text": "制片人还没做出成绩就退出了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8915.91, "timestamp": "02:28:35", "text": "99%的生产者在完成目标前就退出了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8917.67, "timestamp": "02:28:37", "text": "发布他们的热门歌曲之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8919.91, "timestamp": "02:28:39", "text": "那就像一句俗语一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8925.23, "timestamp": "02:28:45", "text": "这件事也可以用其他文体来表达，例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8930.03, "timestamp": "02:28:50", "text": "嗯，不是你可以划分的类型细分领域。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8939.429, "timestamp": "02:28:59", "text": "没错，但那是我的直播，呃，那是我的"}]